OL,3,AFour to face trial accused of murdering
OL,4,Ababy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe adults, all Slovakian nationals,
OL,7,Fwere remanded into custody until the
OL,8,Fnext hearing on 2 October. The girl was
OL,9,Fremanded into youth custody.
